WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.798
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:36.068 --> 00:37.856
We're going to live here from now on.

3
00:37.969 --> 00:39.797
Thank Uncle Metha, Nava.

4
00:39.855 --> 00:40.927
Thank you.

5
00:41.352 --> 00:42.934
You can look around first.

6
00:43.245 --> 00:43.615
Okay.

7
00:44.914 --> 00:45.276
Go ahead.

8
01:01.254 --> 01:01.886
Nam.

9
01:02.619 --> 01:04.265
Do you think Nava will like my house?

10
01:06.402 --> 01:07.728
Why wouldn't she?

11
01:08.207 --> 01:10.099
The old place was terrible.

12
01:11.151 --> 01:12.503
I should be thanking you

13
01:12.562 --> 01:14.584
for inviting Nava and me to live here.

14
01:16.379 --> 01:17.962
I'm happy to do it for you and Nava.

15
01:21.965 --> 01:23.197
It's a shame

16
01:23.452 --> 01:24.411
that we met too late.

17
01:25.047 --> 01:25.713
I...

18
01:26.212 --> 01:28.132
I wish you were Nava's real father.

19
01:29.996 --> 01:31.502
Even though I'm not her biological father,

20
01:33.601 --> 01:34.992
Nava will be my daughter.

21
01:39.200 --> 01:39.887
Thank you.

22
01:50.974 --> 01:52.463
So, Nava, do you like the house?

23
01:52.989 --> 01:53.354
Yes.

24
01:53.649 --> 01:57.604
Mom said you have a big box of colored pencils.

25
01:59.050 --> 01:59.553
I do.

26
02:00.450 --> 02:01.383
It's a really big box.

27
02:02.705 --> 02:03.392
Do you want to see it?

28
02:04.861 --> 02:05.492
Yes.

29
02:09.163 --> 02:09.468
Let's go.

30
02:14.741 --> 02:15.228
Come on.

31
02:34.137 --> 02:35.511
Things happened so suddenly,

32
02:36.189 --> 02:37.591
so I haven't had time to decorate your room yet.

33
02:38.654 --> 02:40.024
If there's anything you want, just tell me.

34
02:41.331 --> 02:43.835
Uncle Metha, you won't be like Dad, will you?

35
02:44.255 --> 02:46.492
Dad always made Mom cry.

36
02:49.610 --> 02:51.089
I'll never be like that.

37
02:52.934 --> 02:54.593
I'll protect you and your mom.

38
02:57.591 --> 02:58.338
I promise.

39
03:07.969 --> 03:08.800
Trust me.

40
03:11.019 --> 03:12.748
I'll keep that promise with my life.

41
03:26.938 --> 03:27.867
One box fell.

42
03:32.476 --> 03:34.080
Thanks for helping me, Nava.

43
03:34.733 --> 03:36.667
It's no trouble at all, Uncle Metha.

44
03:36.990 --> 03:37.677
Hmm...

45
03:37.785 --> 03:39.291
You can stop calling him Uncle.

46
03:39.445 --> 03:41.405
You can call him Dad now.

47
03:42.152 --> 03:42.612
Okay

48
03:42.667 --> 03:43.865
Good girl.

49
03:44.047 --> 03:46.397
I have a reward for you, too.

50
03:48.932 --> 03:50.236
Here.

51
03:50.600 --> 03:52.634
A new coloring book.

52
03:52.966 --> 03:54.156
Do you like it?

53
03:55.281 --> 03:56.433
Thank you, Mom.

54
03:56.569 --> 03:58.838
May I color in it now?

55
03:59.046 --> 03:59.352
Sure.

56
04:09.921 --> 04:11.601
By the way, isn't this a little too much stock?

57
04:12.936 --> 04:14.032
Mr. Pruek said

58
04:14.269 --> 04:15.600
that if we want to succeed,

59
04:15.807 --> 04:17.044
we have to be willing to invest.

60
04:20.509 --> 04:22.234
Is Mr. Pruek really trustworthy, Nam?

61
04:23.024 --> 04:24.851
Come on, Mr. Pruek...

62
04:25.210 --> 04:27.338
He's a billionaire socialite.

63
04:27.709 --> 04:29.400
And his business plan is clear.

64
04:30.146 --> 04:32.225
Besides, if we hit the target,

65
04:32.977 --> 04:35.203
we'll get to go to Finland.

66
04:35.853 --> 04:38.287
You and Nava can see the Northern Lights.

67
04:41.639 --> 04:42.458
I'm just worried, that's all.

68
04:43.177 --> 04:44.633
The economy hasn't been doing well lately.

69
04:47.391 --> 04:48.630
I have a plan.

70
05:00.781 --> 05:01.562
What's this?

71
05:02.417 --> 05:03.955
A partner gave it to me.

72
05:04.163 --> 05:05.816
He said it'll help boost sales,

73
05:06.196 --> 05:07.876
but we have to worship it every day.

74
05:16.925 --> 05:19.303
We'll be going to Finland soon.

75
06:35.615 --> 06:37.228
Well, good morning, Captain.

76
06:37.253 --> 06:39.263
You're in early today.

77
06:39.899 --> 06:41.391
Last night's shift was a mess,

78
06:41.416 --> 06:42.379
so I had to come in and sort it out.

79
06:43.914 --> 06:46.369
You're really eager to make a name for yourself.

80
06:47.221 --> 06:48.208
You call this making a name for myself?

81
06:49.038 --> 06:50.210
All I do is paperwork.

82
06:50.235 --> 06:52.054
I hardly ever get to work on a major case.

83
06:54.276 --> 06:55.025
A major case...

84
06:55.987 --> 06:56.858
Funny you should mention that.

85
06:59.110 --> 07:00.326
Someone filed a complaint today.

86
07:00.691 --> 07:03.216
They said they were scammed by Pruek Phana.

87
07:05.648 --> 07:06.291
Pruek Phana?

88
07:06.855 --> 07:07.248
Yeah.

89
07:08.212 --> 07:09.282
That rich socialite?

90
07:10.025 --> 07:10.543
That's right.

91
07:11.362 --> 07:12.192
Allegedly,

92
07:13.062 --> 07:15.060
he got people to invest in a dietary supplement business

93
07:15.085 --> 07:16.487
then ran off with their money.

94
07:17.778 --> 07:18.966
There are already several victims.

95
07:20.262 --> 07:21.796
But there's still a lot to investigate.

96
07:22.843 --> 07:24.061
If it's true,

97
07:24.939 --> 07:26.142
it'll be big news.

98
07:26.905 --> 07:27.455
And...

99
07:29.133 --> 07:30.106
the amount of money involved?

100
07:30.303 --> 07:32.127
We're talking billions.

101
07:34.312 --> 07:35.711
Bring me that complaint form.

102
07:36.177 --> 07:37.202
Wow.

103
07:37.227 --> 07:38.669
Getting on it quickly, huh?

104
07:38.813 --> 07:40.325
Are you trying to become police chief?

105
07:42.883 --> 07:43.971
I'll handle this case myself.

106
07:44.657 --> 07:45.325
Sure.

107
08:15.496 --> 08:16.641
Please wait a moment.

108
08:28.217 --> 08:29.603
I'm Captain Metha.

109
08:30.108 --> 08:31.365
I'm here to conduct an investigation

110
08:31.915 --> 08:34.364
into allegations of fraud against the public.

111
08:36.599 --> 08:37.324
Officer.

112
08:38.610 --> 08:40.474
You're making accusations against me.

113
08:40.897 --> 08:42.277
Do you have any evidence?

114
08:44.242 --> 08:45.856
I'd like to search the house as well.

115
08:46.491 --> 08:48.422
And do you have a search warrant?

116
08:49.576 --> 08:51.147
Without one, this could be

117
08:51.210 --> 08:52.461
trespassing.

118
08:56.910 --> 08:58.595
You know exactly what you've done.

119
08:59.825 --> 09:00.136
Yes.

120
09:00.601 --> 09:01.228
I do.

121
09:02.106 --> 09:03.318
I'm running a business.

122
09:04.193 --> 09:06.931
How can I be blamed

123
09:07.765 --> 09:08.698
when people choose to invest?

124
09:11.000 --> 09:12.601
But there are several victims.

125
09:12.626 --> 09:13.749
Oh, Officer.

126
09:14.529 --> 09:16.907
I don't think it's right to call them victims.

127
09:18.846 --> 09:20.558
Why didn't they complain when they were making money?

128
09:23.677 --> 09:26.778
Business investments always carry risks, Officer.

129
09:32.743 --> 09:34.200
You think you'll get away with this so easily?

130
09:36.471 --> 09:37.783
I'll gather all the evidence

131
09:39.525 --> 09:40.998
and put you behind bars.

132
09:44.692 --> 09:45.467
Be my guest.

133
09:47.250 --> 09:50.720
But I do have a golf date with Commander Thongchai.

134
09:59.024 --> 10:00.449
Once you have a proper search warrant,

135
10:01.349 --> 10:03.176
we can talk again.

136
10:03.828 --> 10:04.379
That way, please.

137
10:35.206 --> 10:39.398
(I will tell you about our new promotion.)

138
10:39.493 --> 10:40.913
(Here, buy 10, get one free.)

139
10:40.940 --> 10:42.919
Our current promotion is buy 10, get one free.

140
10:43.050 --> 10:47.810
(All our ingredients are natural extracts.)

141
10:47.835 --> 10:51.694
(We guarantee results, with no harmful residues.)

142
10:52.343 --> 10:54.574
Dad, I'm hungry.

143
10:54.662 --> 10:56.995
(You can also win a chance to go abroad.)

144
10:57.630 --> 11:00.186
Oh, hasn't Mom made you anything to eat?

145
11:00.733 --> 11:01.676
(Are you interested?)

146
11:01.862 --> 11:03.700
(Buy 10, get one free.)

147
11:04.283 --> 11:05.373
(That is today's promotion.)

148
11:05.581 --> 11:07.130
Nam, aren't you going to eat?

149
11:07.848 --> 11:09.780
Why don't you take a break and eat?

150
11:11.445 --> 11:14.785
(Yes, it contains both vitamin C and multivitamins.)

151
11:15.462 --> 11:18.364
Yes, it's made from natural extracts.

152
11:19.268 --> 11:19.705
Let's go.

153
11:20.354 --> 11:22.727
(Yes, buy 10, get one free.)

154
11:22.892 --> 11:24.177
(Hurry and place your orders.)

155
11:24.202 --> 11:25.372
(Buy 10, get one free.)

156
11:25.697 --> 11:27.034
If you'd like to become a member,

157
11:27.241 --> 11:28.976
you can sign up right now.

158
11:29.073 --> 11:31.015
We guarantee a minimum income

159
11:31.274 --> 11:32.937
of 50,000 baht a month.

160
11:32.962 --> 11:34.621
That's just the minimum.

161
11:34.676 --> 11:35.674
As for our vitamins,

162
11:35.952 --> 11:37.869
they're made from natural extracts.

163
11:37.894 --> 11:41.773
They have no side effects and leave no harmful residue.

164
12:50.841 --> 12:52.115
Did you see that?

165
13:04.455 --> 13:04.892
Eat!

166
13:06.466 --> 13:07.646
I said eat!

167
13:09.064 --> 13:09.571
Eat!

168
13:10.029 --> 13:10.794
Eat!

169
13:11.550 --> 13:12.079
Eat!

170
13:12.144 --> 13:13.262
Nam, stop!

171
13:14.874 --> 13:15.720
What's going on?

172
13:18.047 --> 13:19.677
I just want Nava to eat more.

173
13:24.475 --> 13:26.120
It's okay, Nava.

174
13:26.811 --> 13:28.198
If you don't want to eat, you don't have to.

175
13:38.310 --> 13:38.719
Wait.

176
13:44.958 --> 13:47.549
Right now, I'm gathering evidence against Pruek.

177
13:48.793 --> 13:49.583
Just wait a little longer.

178
13:51.013 --> 13:51.874
I'll help you.

179
13:51.899 --> 13:52.253
No!

180
13:53.692 --> 13:54.375
It's okay.

181
14:01.035 --> 14:02.218
Everything's fine now.

182
16:34.412 --> 16:35.399
You're not getting away.

183
16:38.717 --> 16:39.849
Hey.

184
16:39.874 --> 16:41.867
Thot, perfect timing.

185
16:41.982 --> 16:43.796
I've almost finished compiling the evidence against Pruek.

186
16:44.177 --> 16:44.783
All that's left is...

187
16:44.808 --> 16:45.583
Metha.!

188
16:46.089 --> 16:46.751
Stop.

189
16:48.606 --> 16:49.289
The Pruek case...

190
16:53.903 --> 16:54.828
It's been thrown out.

191
16:57.166 --> 16:58.763
What do you mean?

192
17:08.918 --> 17:14.995
(Pruek Phana held a press conference.)

193
17:15.445 --> 17:19.312
He said he had no involvement

194
17:19.337 --> 17:23.148
in the manager's alleged mismanagement,

195
17:23.797 --> 17:25.560
and insisted

196
17:25.585 --> 17:28.517
that he was innocent of all charges.

197
17:28.542 --> 17:37.190
He also said he was willing to cooperate with the police.

198
17:42.349 --> 17:43.189
Mom.

199
17:44.447 --> 17:45.555
Mom.

200
19:05.203 --> 19:05.837
Metha.

201
19:07.343 --> 19:07.899
Metha.

202
19:08.807 --> 19:09.996
Come look at this. Hurry.

203
19:11.108 --> 19:11.894
Hurry!

204
19:12.018 --> 19:13.290
What's going on?

205
19:18.439 --> 19:19.905
Are you ready?

206
19:20.158 --> 19:23.572
I'm taking you to kill that man, Pruek.

207
19:28.592 --> 19:29.095
Let's go.

208
20:12.235 --> 20:12.988
Officer!

209
20:19.454 --> 20:21.274
Officer, help me! This woman has gone crazy!

210
20:21.299 --> 20:22.153
Don't move!

211
20:27.688 --> 20:28.642
Shh.

212
20:51.215 --> 20:52.445
Let Pruek go.

213
20:55.182 --> 20:56.691
It's not too late.

214
20:59.270 --> 21:00.836
We can still go home.

215
21:03.815 --> 21:04.984
Nam.

216
21:05.523 --> 21:07.006
Why are you helping him?

217
21:07.065 --> 21:08.040
Nava.

218
21:08.288 --> 21:08.866
Nava.

219
21:10.022 --> 21:11.178
Nava's waiting.

220
21:15.727 --> 21:18.352
If the law can't do anything to him,

221
21:21.890 --> 21:23.819
I'll punish him myself.

222
21:42.108 --> 21:42.774
Nam.

223
21:49.085 --> 21:50.379
Put the knife down.

224
21:51.056 --> 21:52.231
It's over.

225
22:22.073 --> 22:23.876
It's over.

226
22:26.425 --> 22:27.738
Let's go home.

227
22:30.918 --> 22:31.980
It's over.

228
22:36.227 --> 22:37.116
Yes

229
22:56.683 --> 22:57.621
Nam!

230
23:02.582 --> 23:04.155
Call an ambulance!

231
23:04.814 --> 23:05.327
Hurry!

232
23:39.840 --> 23:40.289
Hey.

233
23:43.178 --> 23:44.524
It's not your fault.

234
23:49.198 --> 23:50.832
But I couldn't save anyone.

235
23:54.968 --> 23:56.949
What's the point of being a police officer?

236
24:10.620 --> 24:12.241
(Nam!)

237
24:19.754 --> 24:21.616
Why did you let me die?

238
24:37.753 --> 24:39.367
Why didn't you help me?

239
24:41.414 --> 24:42.194
You're a police officer,

240
24:42.721 --> 24:44.212
but you can't catch the bad guy.

241
24:48.755 --> 24:49.088
Nam.

242
24:52.147 --> 24:53.257
I'm sorry.

243
24:54.198 --> 24:56.669
It's my fault I couldn't help you.

244
24:58.567 --> 25:00.197
Then take responsibility.

245
25:02.930 --> 25:03.973
You promised

246
25:04.488 --> 25:06.307
you'd protect me with your life.

247
25:06.628 --> 25:07.038
Huh?

248
25:08.229 --> 25:08.921
Right?

249
25:09.453 --> 25:10.587
Metha.

250
25:12.890 --> 25:14.297
Don't answer her!

251
25:16.949 --> 25:17.856
Get a hold of yourself!

252
25:18.898 --> 25:20.649
Are you going to throw your life away here?

253
25:21.428 --> 25:23.369
You said you had Nava to raise.

254
25:24.537 --> 25:26.125
And we don't even know if that's really Nam.

255
25:30.538 --> 25:31.717
Think carefully.

256
25:35.440 --> 25:36.702
(Thank you)

257
25:43.563 --> 25:43.970
No.

258
25:48.828 --> 25:49.610
This is not Nam.

259
26:11.566 --> 26:13.272
Then who do you think it is?

260
26:20.624 --> 26:21.289
Dear.

261
26:22.400 --> 26:24.430
Go get the stuffed rabbit from the locker room.

262
26:24.455 --> 26:25.492
Okay.

263
26:46.942 --> 26:47.949
Smells good.

264
26:49.186 --> 26:50.375
Looks tasty.

265
26:58.576 --> 26:59.918
Metha.

266
27:01.439 --> 27:03.190
Metha, I'm sorry.

267
27:05.331 --> 27:06.988
Please don't be angry with me.

268
27:07.741 --> 27:09.230
Please, Metha.

269
27:11.387 --> 27:13.194
Don't stay silent.

270
27:14.699 --> 27:16.308
You can't fool me.

271
27:45.466 --> 27:46.047
Cherd.

272
27:46.113 --> 27:49.010
Perfect timing. Help Metha, quick!

273
27:52.398 --> 27:53.625
I can't help, Dear.

274
27:55.672 --> 27:57.263
You're the store manager.

275
27:57.328 --> 27:58.629
You have to be able to do something.

276
28:03.808 --> 28:05.237
Every man for himself.

277
28:06.268 --> 28:08.618
So you're just going to let Metha die?

278
29:24.940 --> 29:26.286
Are you hungry, ma'am?

279
29:28.632 --> 29:30.219
We have special promotions today.

280
29:31.890 --> 29:33.531
Ready-to-eat meals are 30% off.

281
29:33.722 --> 29:35.253
Buy two chicken sausages, get one free.

282
29:35.278 --> 29:36.973
Sandwiches paired with drinks at a special price.

283
29:37.202 --> 29:37.897
And...

284
29:37.922 --> 29:38.560
we also have

285
29:38.585 --> 29:40.988
discounted desserts, cakes, and puddings.

286
29:55.930 --> 29:57.427
What did you say?

287
29:59.583 --> 30:00.948
Help yourself.

288
30:02.967 --> 30:04.446
Is it free?

289
30:06.789 --> 30:07.466
Yes.

290
30:10.078 --> 30:11.715
I'll pay for it myself.

291
30:45.680 --> 30:48.656
(Wait a moment, Commander.)

292
30:50.794 --> 30:53.765
Hello, welcome to Sunny Mart.

293
30:59.367 --> 31:00.409
Commander, trust me.

294
31:00.900 --> 31:02.984
My business is going to go far.

295
31:03.626 --> 31:04.838
And if you help me,

296
31:07.435 --> 31:09.034
I'll make it worth your while.

297
31:10.045 --> 31:10.928
But for now,

298
31:11.731 --> 31:13.602
let me grab one more can, Commander.

299
31:14.146 --> 31:15.395
Let's celebrate in advance.

300
31:18.219 --> 31:18.924
Yes.

301
31:31.576 --> 31:33.952
Why do you look familiar?

302
31:35.294 --> 31:37.546
Oh.

303
31:38.639 --> 31:40.561
You're looking at me like that...

304
31:44.222 --> 31:45.362
You're the cop

305
31:45.414 --> 31:47.996
who came to my house wanting to put me behind bars.

306
31:48.680 --> 31:49.921
Why don't you arrest me?

307
31:50.212 --> 31:51.348
Go on, arrest me.

308
31:52.240 --> 31:53.512
Come on.

309
31:58.409 --> 31:59.681
Pathetic.

310
32:02.843 --> 32:04.571
Loser.

311
32:07.433 --> 32:07.966
Hey!

312
32:08.600 --> 32:09.471
You're in the way.

313
32:10.410 --> 32:12.206
What are you doing here?

314
32:26.364 --> 32:28.772
Nam, don't!

315
33:28.320 --> 33:29.433
Nam!

316
33:30.547 --> 33:30.969
That's enough.

317
33:36.997 --> 33:38.520
Hey!

318
33:42.339 --> 33:44.330
Nam!

319
34:06.605 --> 34:07.804
Do you remember?

320
34:13.951 --> 34:14.936
No!

321
34:19.498 --> 34:20.278
No!

322
34:20.615 --> 34:20.975
No!

323
34:21.934 --> 34:22.810
Nava.

324
34:24.048 --> 34:25.545
Nava is still waiting for you.

325
34:32.487 --> 34:32.978
Nava.

326
34:33.673 --> 34:34.213
Nava.

327
34:37.857 --> 34:38.926
Nava, my baby.

328
34:40.545 --> 34:41.285
Nava.

329
34:59.323 --> 35:00.297
Stop it!

330
35:02.540 --> 35:03.098
No!

331
35:03.255 --> 35:04.060
Quiet!

332
35:04.485 --> 35:05.733
No!

333
35:09.225 --> 35:09.896
Get out!

334
35:10.303 --> 35:11.282
Get out!

335
35:11.473 --> 35:12.321
